<title>UK: WestLB sets 100 mln mark step-up May 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>WestLB sets 100 mln mark step-up May 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Westdeutsche Landesbank GZ.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ, DUSSELDORF</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *3.65	MATURITY   *30.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  S 04.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    DUSS	DENOMS (M)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 29.MAY.97 THEN STEPS-UP TO 4.3 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>	    **CALLABLE AT PAR ON 30.MAY.97</p>
<p>	    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
